Subject: [PATCH] downloads: serialize shared parent setup and use portable
 HTTP tests

UniFile SAF creates directories with an unsynchronized find-then-create sequence. Serialize only source/anime directory resolution on the shared provider, leaving transfers parallel. Exercise the actual provider from two threads.

Replace the JDK-only HttpServer test fixture rejected by Android unit-test compilation with a bounded standard ServerSocket fixture. Preserve real two-video transfer, concurrency, storage isolation and cleanup assertions.
